        <h1>70s Slow Songs: 30 Ballads to Play Start to Finish</h1>

        <p class="post-byline">By <a href="https://musicofthe70s.net/about/author/">Charlie</a> &middot; Published {{DATE_LONG}}</p>
        <p class="jump-to-list"><a class="btn-primary jump-btn" href="#slow-songs-list">&#9654; Jump to the playable list</a></p>

        <p class="post-intro">The best 70s slow songs are the ones that make a room go quiet.</p>
        <p class="post-intro">This page collects {{N}} of them, three from every year of the decade.</p>
        <p class="post-intro">You can play every one from the table below.</p>
        <p class="post-intro">{{N1}} of the {{N}} reached number one on the Billboard Hot 100.</p>
        <p class="post-intro">Each row carries one line of chart fact, not a guess.</p>

